tell me "━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━"
tell me "📈 SECTION 5: FACTORIAL & COMBINATORICS"
tell me "━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━"
tell me ""

fn factorial_calc(n) {
    today result is 1
    today i is 2
    
    while i <= n {
        result = result * i
        i = i + 1
    }
    
    return result
}

fn permutation_calc(n, r) {
    today numerator is factorial_calc(n)
    today denominator is factorial_calc(n - r)
    return numerator / denominator
}

fn combination_calc(n, r) {
    today num is permutation_calc(n, r)
    today denom is factorial_calc(r)
    return num / denom
}

# Test: Factorials
tell me "Factorials:"
tell me "  5! = " + factorial_calc(5)
tell me "  7! = " + factorial_calc(7)
tell me ""

# Test: Permutations & Combinations
tell me "Permutations & Combinations:"
tell me "  P(5,3) = " + permutation_calc(5, 3)
tell me "  C(5,3) = " + combination_calc(5, 3)
tell me ""


